    "title": "Former Shelby County Division of Corrections Investigator sentenced to federal prison for bribery - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBBJ Staff ,\n16 hours ago MEMPHIS, Tenn. (WBBJ) – A federal judge has sentenced Deon Scott, 41, a former Internal Affairs Investigator for the Office of Professional Standards for the Shelby County Divisions of Corrections to federal prison for bribery. D. Michael Dunavant, United States Attorney for the Western District of Tennessee, announced the sentence today. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
